## ------------------------------------------------------------------ Mystery events
# {id}.name is the title; choice/result/fail are numbered in the order the choices appear.
# Derelict Freighter
event.derelict-freighter.name = Derelict Freighter
event.derelict-freighter.body = A gutted freighter drifts in silence, its cargo bay half open. Your scanners pick up sealed crates inside, and a faint hum from its security grid.
event.derelict-freighter.choice.0 = Strip the cargo bay
event.derelict-freighter.result.0 = The turrets wake up as you cut the last crate loose. You get out with the salvage, and a few new scorch marks.
event.derelict-freighter.choice.1 = Scan it from a safe distance
event.derelict-freighter.result.1 = You tag a few loose containers and tow them clear.
event.derelict-freighter.choice.2 = Leave it
event.derelict-freighter.result.2 = Whatever it was guarding, it can keep.

# Distress Beacon
event.distress-beacon.name = Distress Beacon
event.distress-beacon.body = An old Pathfinder beacon is looping a distress call. The signal looks genuine, but the Remnant have used lures like this before.
event.distress-beacon.choice.0 = Answer the call
event.distress-beacon.result.0 = You find a scout's escape pod, empty, its cargo still sealed. The crew left you something good.
event.distress-beacon.fail.0 = The beacon goes dark. Remnant fighters drop out of the static around you.
event.distress-beacon.choice.1 = Log it and move on
event.distress-beacon.result.1 = You mark the coordinates for whoever comes next.

# Unstable Singularity
event.singularity.name = Unstable Singularity
event.singularity.body = A pocket of collapsed space hums ahead. Its pull could tear the hull apart, or fold Dark Matter straight out of the void.
event.singularity.choice.0 = Skim the event horizon
event.singularity.result.0 = The hull groans and buckles, but the collectors come back full.
event.singularity.choice.1 = Steer clear
event.singularity.result.1 = Some risks aren't worth taking.

# Wandering Engineer
event.engineer.name = Wandering Engineer
event.engineer.body = A lone engineer in a patched-up shuttle hails you. "Nice ship. I could make her sing, for the right price."
event.engineer.choice.0 = Tune up an item
event.engineer.result.0 = She works fast and talks faster. Your ship has never felt this sharp.
event.engineer.choice.1 = Patch the hull
event.engineer.result.1 = A few welds and a lot of sealant later, the hull is whole again.
event.engineer.choice.2 = Decline
event.engineer.result.2 = "Your loss," she says, and drifts off.

# Spore Bloom
event.spore-bloom.name = Spore Bloom
event.spore-bloom.body = Glowing spores drift through the nebula and settle on the hull. Wherever they land, damaged plating knits itself back together.
event.spore-bloom.choice.0 = Let them grow
event.spore-bloom.result.0 = The hull is whole again, if a little heavier. The growth isn't coming off.
event.spore-bloom.choice.1 = Burn them off
event.spore-bloom.result.1 = The spores crisp into a fine, glittering ash. Traders pay well for it.

# Remnant Toll Gate
event.remnant-toll.name = Remnant Toll Gate
event.remnant-toll.body = A Remnant checkpoint blocks the jump lane. "This sector is ours, Pathfinder. Pay the toll, or turn around."
event.remnant-toll.choice.0 = Pay the toll
event.remnant-toll.result.0 = They take the Scraps and wave you through. For now.
event.remnant-toll.choice.1 = Run the blockade
event.remnant-toll.result.1 = You punch the engines. The gate's guns light up behind you.

# Sealed Weapons Cache
event.weapons-cache.name = Sealed Weapons Cache
event.weapons-cache.body = A military cache, still locked with an old access code. You could try to crack it, but the failsafe is explosive.
event.weapons-cache.choice.0 = Crack the lock
event.weapons-cache.result.0 = The lock clicks open. Whoever stashed this had good taste.
event.weapons-cache.fail.0 = The failsafe goes off in your face.
event.weapons-cache.choice.1 = Cut it open carefully
event.weapons-cache.result.1 = Slow and steady. The cache opens without a spark.
event.weapons-cache.choice.2 = Leave it
event.weapons-cache.result.2 = You leave the cache to the next brave fool.

# Echo of Earth
event.earth-echo.name = Echo of Earth
event.earth-echo.body = A fragment of an old Earth broadcast loops in the static: music, laughter, a weather report for a city that no longer exists. The cockpit goes quiet.
event.earth-echo.choice.0 = Just listen
event.earth-echo.result.0 = For a few minutes, you remember what you're fighting for.
event.earth-echo.choice.1 = Record it for the archive
event.earth-echo.result.1 = The Lab will want this. Every scrap of home matters.

# Scrap Trader
event.scrap-trader.name = Scrap Trader
event.scrap-trader.body = A trader's barge, bristling with salvage, pulls alongside. "I deal in tech. One of yours for one of mine. Or I'll just buy yours."
event.scrap-trader.choice.0 = Trade an item
event.scrap-trader.result.0 = The trader picks something from your racks and hands over a crate in return.
event.scrap-trader.choice.1 = Sell an item
event.scrap-trader.result.1 = \"Pleasure doing business."
event.scrap-trader.choice.2 = Move on
event.scrap-trader.result.2 = The barge drifts back into the dark.

# Gravity Well
event.gravity-well.name = Gravity Well
event.gravity-well.body = The jump drops you into a gravity well around a dead star. Breaking free will cost you something.
event.gravity-well.choice.0 = Burn the engines hard
event.gravity-well.result.0 = The hull shrieks, but you tear free.
event.gravity-well.choice.1 = Jettison salvage
event.gravity-well.result.1 = Lighter, you slip out of the well.
event.gravity-well.choice.2 = Slingshot around the core
event.gravity-well.result.2 = You whip around the core and come out trailing Dark Matter.
event.gravity-well.fail.2 = The core nearly swallows you. You claw your way out, barely.
